<title>UK: Drink offers alcohol-free benefits of red wine.</title>
<headline>Drink offers alcohol-free benefits of red wine.</headline>
<byline>Maggie Fox</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teetotallers take heart -- now you, too can share the benefits of a drop or two of wine, British researchers said on Thursday.</p>
